18. MongoDB Indexes
Indexes are important for performance.

Create:

app/db/indexes.py

from app.db.collections import (
    farmers_collection,
    crops_collection,
    conversations_collection,
    messages_collection
)


def create_indexes():

    farmers_collection.create_index(
        "phone",
        unique=True,
        sparse=True
    )

    crops_collection.create_index(
        "farmer_id"
    )

    conversations_collection.create_index(
        "farmer_id"
    )

    messages_collection.create_index(
        "conversation_id"
    )

Call this during application startup:

from app.db.indexes import create_indexes


@app.on_event("startup")
def startup():

    create_indexes()

For newer FastAPI applications, lifespan events are preferable to the older startup/shutdown decorator.

