23. MongoDB Vector Search
If the chosen MongoDB deployment supports the required vector-search functionality, agricultural document embeddings can also be stored in MongoDB.

Example document:

{
  "_id": "ObjectId(...)",

  "title": "Rice Water Management",

  "source": "Agricultural Knowledge Base",

  "content": "Rice water management...",

  "language": "en",

  "crop": "rice",

  "embedding": [
    0.012,
    -0.038,
    0.104
  ],

  "created_at":
    "2026-09-30T00:00:00Z"
}

The exact vector index definition depends on the MongoDB deployment/version being used.

